  "caveats": [
    "EXPLORATORY. Small n (10 positives / 30 negatives); Boruta's shadow null addresses relevance-vs-noise, not sampling stability at this n.",
    "COHORT CONFOUND (hard, finding 0001): ADD is 100% Kerchner cohort. Among these 40 samples 'ADD' and 'Kerchner' are the SAME partition, so the Confirmed set is all-relevant to the ADD-vs-Other partition, which is ALIASED with collection site \u2014 NOT necessarily all-relevant to disease. The shadow null does NOT resolve this confound.",
    "Matrix is already median-normalized + limma/ComBat batch-corrected on Cohort (finding 0004); feeding Boruta the corrected matrix is legitimate for selection (not a per-feature significance test).",
    "Direction labels are taken from the moderated DE contrast (log2FC ADD-Other); the DE 'gene' column is empty for this dataset, so short_name is the UniProt entry mnemonic, not a curated HGNC symbol."
  ]
